{"id":"dd458e14301e0670","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-hierarchy-definition.md","title":"Cumulative Hierarchy Properties","display":"thm-hierarchy-properties — Cumulative Hierarchy Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hierarchy-properties","aliases":["58-thm-hierarchy-properties","58-thm-hierarchy-definition"],"display":"thm-hierarchy-properties — Cumulative Hierarchy Properties","depends_on":["[[58-df-hierarchy]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hierarchy-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hierarchy-properties</span><span>58-thm-hierarchy-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hierarchy-properties — Cumulative Hierarchy Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> is the cumulative-hierarchy term from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> is the one-place predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V_\\alpha)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}monotone} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}monotone} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}exhaustive} \\vdash \\forall x\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in V_\\alpha\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}exhaustive} \\vdash \\forall x\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in V_\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every set appears at some level <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\alpha}\">\\(V_{\\alpha}\\)</span> of the cumulative hierarchy.</li>\n<li>These are consequences of the zero, successor, and limit recursion in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"58-df-hierarchy\">58-df-hierarchy</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in V$, $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ is the ordinal predicate, and $V_\\alpha$ is the cumulative-hierarchy term from [[58-df-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S$ is the one-place predicate from [[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19e9a8c33d5c841c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"These are consequences of the zero, successor, and limit recursion in [[58-df-hierarchy]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}transitive} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V_\\alpha)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}monotone} \\vdash \\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha<\\beta\\to V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}exhaustive} \\vdash \\forall x\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land x\\in V_\\alpha\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V_{\\alpha}","display":false}],"bytes":1361,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-hierarchy-definition.md|58-thm-hierarchy-definition]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["19e9a8c33d5c841c","5582a281f15a33c2","c14ba496c480dcd6"]}